I take my rented racket in my hand.
I walk towards a court.
Three people are warming up there.
They seem very friendly.
I go near them.
I smile and say, "Hello, my name is Maya."
A woman says, "Hello Maya, I am Neha."
"And these are Amit and Sanjay."
Amit and Sanjay also say hello to me.
I ask them, "Do you need one more player?"
"I like to play doubles a lot."
"Can I play with you?"
Amit says, "Yes, absolutely!"
"We also want to play doubles."
Sanjay asks, "Can you play right now?"
I say, "Yes, I am ready."
Neha says, "Alright, then let's begin."
We go onto the court.
